WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:06.540
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.740 --> 00:09.740
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.150 --> 00:12.120
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.520 --> 00:14.680
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.460 --> 00:20.160
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:41.260
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.260 --> 00:46.930
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.690
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.690 --> 00:53.710
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.910 --> 01:00.580
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.580 --> 01:05.590
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:06.000 --> 01:10.810
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:15.570
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.380
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:22.420
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.740
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.740 --> 01:29.670
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.670 --> 01:34.080
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:38.770
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.990
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:49.170
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:52.730 --> 01:56.160
<i>The Kingdom of Bosse is awash 
in Miranjo's intrigue.</i>

01:56.800 --> 01:59.800
<i>Bosse, who had come back to life 
by taking Daida's body from him,</i>

02:00.210 --> 02:05.560
<i>has ordered Dorshe to take 
Hiling and leave the kingdom.</i>

02:09.530 --> 02:12.270
Daida! Where are you?!

02:12.270 --> 02:13.340
Daida!

02:13.340 --> 02:15.860
Mother! Mother!

02:15.860 --> 02:18.250
Daida? So you're over there, are you?

02:20.910 --> 02:24.740
I promise... I promise you I'll get 
you get you out of there, okay?

02:24.740 --> 02:26.900
Just bear with it a little longer!

02:27.270 --> 02:30.020
Daida! Daida!

02:32.500 --> 02:36.630
<b>Hiling's Old Friend</b>

02:34.130 --> 02:35.350
Where am I?

02:39.290 --> 02:40.550
Queen Hiling!

02:40.550 --> 02:41.840
Dorshe...

02:43.270 --> 02:45.040
How are you feeling?

02:45.040 --> 02:50.150
Where in the world are we? I have to 
save Daida as quickly as possible.

02:51.710 --> 02:55.100
What are you waiting for?! 
Get ready to go back to the castle!

02:55.690 --> 03:00.190
Queen Hiling, we cannot return 
to the castle right now.

03:00.590 --> 03:02.010
What do you mean?

03:04.560 --> 03:07.490
If you don't want her to die, 
get out of the country.

03:07.490 --> 03:10.450
And then bide your time.

03:10.900 --> 03:13.200
What will happen if we wait?

03:14.520 --> 03:17.620
I am only going with the flow myself.

03:17.990 --> 03:19.080
Go on!

03:20.000 --> 03:23.300
Queen Hiling, please remain calm.

03:24.760 --> 03:27.310
Even so, I'm going back to the castle.

03:28.610 --> 03:29.770
Please wait!

03:32.020 --> 03:36.340
I am going to rescue Daida, 
even if it costs me my life!

03:36.340 --> 03:40.330
And if you try to stop me, 
I'll have you executed!

03:46.560 --> 03:49.670
You know we cannot attempt this alone.

03:50.150 --> 03:53.670
At the very least, we will 
need some capable allies.

03:56.840 --> 03:59.330
Allies I've got.

04:07.030 --> 04:10.510
I'm here to ask if there is 
a warrior named Ann here.

04:10.510 --> 04:13.540
Hmm? Who are you?

04:13.540 --> 04:16.490
Tell her it's the monastic who traveled 
with her. She'll know who I am.

04:17.220 --> 04:20.300
I have important business with 
her. Let me see her at once.

04:20.880 --> 04:22.260
Hiling, is that you?

04:24.620 --> 04:27.660
I'm surprised you made 
it all the way out here.

04:28.200 --> 04:29.240
Ann!

04:37.430 --> 04:38.960
I understand the situation.

04:38.960 --> 04:39.700
Then you mean...

04:39.700 --> 04:43.200
However, just as you have 
someone you want to keep safe,

04:43.200 --> 04:46.990
I have that which <i>I</i> need 
to keep safe as well.

04:48.220 --> 04:51.470
During our travels, he developed a fever.

04:52.300 --> 04:56.040
The people of this village saved 
us when we were in trouble.

04:56.590 --> 04:59.730
I asked them if there was anything 
we could do to thank them.

05:00.190 --> 05:03.820
Alluvial gold was discovered in a river 
that runs through this village recently,

05:03.820 --> 05:06.780
and it turns out that they've 
been targeted by some bandits.

05:07.560 --> 05:10.650
I'm sorry. I want to help you,

05:10.940 --> 05:13.130
but I can't leave the village right now.

05:13.130 --> 05:15.780
Fine, then let's go take down those bandits!

05:16.530 --> 05:18.540
Queen Hiling, what are you saying?

05:19.420 --> 05:22.870
We don't have to wait for them 
to come here. We can go to them.

05:22.870 --> 05:24.810
You mustn't! It's too dangerous!

05:24.810 --> 05:25.890
What are you talking about?

05:26.330 --> 05:29.130
Ann's here, and you're one of the Big Four!

05:29.130 --> 05:30.910
We can take care of them, no problem!

05:30.910 --> 05:31.830
Perhaps, but...

05:32.180 --> 05:35.050
That's that. We leave tomorrow.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.800
You got that, Ann?

05:40.830 --> 05:43.420
Hiling, you're too much.

05:46.960 --> 05:49.100
How many bandits are there?

05:49.390 --> 05:51.520
I'd say about twenty of them.

05:51.520 --> 05:55.500
Their leader, Dodon, is especially 
well known around these parts.

05:55.500 --> 05:57.580
He's big, and he's powerful.

05:58.010 --> 06:01.670
He's just a bandit, right? 
That's no big deal.

06:01.670 --> 06:05.680
No, we must stay on our toes, 
and be ready for anything.

06:05.680 --> 06:08.400
Honestly, you're such a worrywart.

06:08.400 --> 06:13.260
Call me what you will, but it is 
my job to ensure your safety.

06:18.140 --> 06:19.450
How did you fare?

06:19.800 --> 06:22.990
They've established a stronghold 
on the other side of that ridge.

06:22.990 --> 06:25.510
They also appear to be taking 
extreme precautions.

06:25.510 --> 06:27.080
I see. Nice work.

06:27.410 --> 06:28.190
What do we do?

06:29.980 --> 06:32.370
Our numbers are few.

06:32.370 --> 06:34.910
Let's launch a surprise attack 
at daybreak, when they're still asleep.

06:35.140 --> 06:35.980
Mm-hmm.

06:37.560 --> 06:40.010
Huh? We can't! Let's attack them now!

06:40.010 --> 06:41.560
While we're standing around here, Daida is—

06:41.560 --> 06:45.640
No! I cannot expose you to any more danger!

06:45.930 --> 06:50.420
Besides, if anything were to happen 
to you, what would become of King Daida?

06:53.030 --> 06:54.470
Fine...

07:06.760 --> 07:08.480
Time to change the guard?

07:08.480 --> 07:13.000
No, Dou is standing watch. 
And Hiling is... asleep.

07:13.520 --> 07:17.710
We walked a long way today. 
She must be exhausted.

07:19.450 --> 07:21.120
In all honesty,

07:21.120 --> 07:24.930
I don't think we should return to the 
Kingdom of Bosse for the time being.

07:29.620 --> 07:30.630
Want some?

07:31.390 --> 07:32.620
Don't mind if I do.

07:33.660 --> 07:37.340
I understand how Queen Hiling must 
feel when it comes to King Daida.

07:38.000 --> 07:41.410
But right now, it's too dangerous 
for us in the Kingdom of Bosse.

07:44.910 --> 07:47.310
Hey, this is alcohol!

07:47.310 --> 07:51.030
Keep your voice down. You'll wake up Hiling.

07:58.430 --> 08:01.320
She's always been a stubborn one.

08:01.320 --> 08:05.020
She sticks to whatever she believes 
is right and acts on it.

08:06.410 --> 08:09.360
Sometimes her sense of what's right 
creates the wrong impression,

08:09.360 --> 08:12.320
but it's something I like about Hiling.

08:13.000 --> 08:17.600
I know what you mean. I thought she 
was just a stern woman at first,

08:17.600 --> 08:19.530
but I've realized that 
she's surprisingly kind.

08:20.680 --> 08:22.730
She's <i>still</i> pretty stern though, right?

08:23.120 --> 08:24.900
Heh, that's for sure.

08:26.420 --> 08:27.720
Daida...

08:33.540 --> 08:35.140
We'll protect her.

08:35.140 --> 08:36.280
Absolutely.

08:41.920 --> 08:44.750
Hey, it's time to change the guard. Hmm?

08:44.750 --> 08:47.890
Guys, you can't sleep on the job! Hey!

08:50.030 --> 08:50.720
What's wrong?

08:54.870 --> 08:55.830
Who's there?!

09:01.560 --> 09:02.720
Intruders!

09:02.970 --> 09:06.060
Boss! Boss!

09:06.670 --> 09:08.700
What's going on?!

09:14.860 --> 09:17.700
Eh? What do you want?

09:18.220 --> 09:20.910
We're here from Zakuri 
Village with a warning.

09:21.260 --> 09:22.870
Leave the village alone!

09:30.610 --> 09:33.300
You expect us to just sit back and watch

09:33.300 --> 09:35.370
when there's treasure right under our noses?

09:35.710 --> 09:37.400
Let them have it, men!

09:59.540 --> 10:00.500
<i>Ann...</i>

10:01.360 --> 10:02.610
Hyah!

10:03.870 --> 10:07.110
The disrespect! Do you realize who I am?!

10:07.110 --> 10:08.170
Execute him! Execute him!

10:08.730 --> 10:10.040
Queen Hiling!

10:19.430 --> 10:21.740
Why, you squirrelly little...

10:30.710 --> 10:32.310
You're finished!

10:33.250 --> 10:34.180
Stop right there!

10:35.380 --> 10:36.960
Holy Light!

10:41.400 --> 10:42.150
Ann!

10:46.340 --> 10:47.250
Damn it!

10:49.750 --> 10:50.930
I'll kill you for that!

10:53.430 --> 10:54.580
Use these!

10:57.220 --> 10:58.580
Ann!

11:34.520 --> 11:36.430
Please spare me...

12:03.170 --> 12:04.690
Death Promise!

12:15.270 --> 12:18.430
If you ever do any more evil deeds,

12:18.430 --> 12:22.850
those wounds will open up again, 
and you will die from loss of blood.

12:24.420 --> 12:28.080
So if you want to stay alive, 
you'll have to change your ways.

12:29.350 --> 12:34.600
Take your men to protect the village,
 and work for their sake.

12:39.410 --> 12:41.730
Yes, ma'am!

12:41.730 --> 12:44.360
Now, I need to go heal the others.

12:44.720 --> 12:47.850
Hiling, when did you learn 
a spell like that?

12:50.010 --> 12:51.820
I made it up, obviously.

12:56.140 --> 12:58.040
You're something else!

13:10.050 --> 13:12.180
I hope this is a weight off your mind.

13:12.180 --> 13:15.310
Yeah. Now I can leave with no reservations.

13:15.970 --> 13:20.140
There are two others we can call on. 
You can't have too many allies.

13:20.620 --> 13:23.160
Let's go and save your son.

13:26.460 --> 13:28.920
Dorshe, make ready to leave at once.

13:29.450 --> 13:30.380
Right.

13:36.870 --> 13:36.960
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

13:36.960 --> 13:37.040
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

13:37.040 --> 13:37.170
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

13:37.170 --> 13:41.840
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

13:41.840 --> 13:46.840
<b>Daida and Magic</b>

13:43.010 --> 13:46.180
<i>Once, when the Kingdom of 
Bosse was still at peace,</i>

13:46.850 --> 13:48.930
<i>a younger Bojji and Daida</i>

13:48.930 --> 13:53.800
<i>lived happily with their father, 
Bosse, and mother, Hiling.</i>

14:19.670 --> 14:20.890
Mother!

14:20.890 --> 14:24.780
I want to be able to heal 
wounds too, just like you do!

14:26.140 --> 14:27.270
Well...

14:27.760 --> 14:32.220
The important thing is to have 
the genuine desire to heal.

14:33.640 --> 14:35.970
Think only about this flower,

14:35.970 --> 14:37.930
and try concentrating your energy into it.

14:45.960 --> 14:50.540
It won't be something you can do 
on your first try. Now, try again.

14:52.850 --> 14:56.370
Now, you don't have to rush into it. 
Keep practicing, nice and easy.

15:11.040 --> 15:13.020
Why can't I do it?

15:20.010 --> 15:21.250
Brother...

16:03.680 --> 16:08.320
Brother... if you run so 
far away, Mother will be...

16:08.680 --> 16:11.650
Prince Bojji! Prince Bojji! Prince Daida!

16:09.450 --> 16:11.650
Bojji! Daida!

16:13.190 --> 16:16.010
You there! Search harder!

16:17.680 --> 16:21.670
Brother... I told you, don't go so far...

16:50.110 --> 16:51.100
Brother!

16:51.580 --> 16:53.200
Let's get back to the castle!

17:13.550 --> 17:17.880
We can't! We have to hurry and go home,
 or Mother will be angry at us!

17:34.790 --> 17:38.250
I-I'm <i>not</i> afraid, okay?!

17:53.640 --> 17:55.330
Brother!

18:23.220 --> 18:26.810
Brother, I can't leave you down there!

18:48.500 --> 18:50.180
I'm almost there.

19:21.010 --> 19:22.220
Brother...

19:30.940 --> 19:32.800
Brother, you're hurt.

20:38.890 --> 20:40.680
Mother...

20:41.390 --> 20:44.580
Daida! Thank goodness! Are you all right?

20:44.580 --> 20:46.030
Does it hurt anywhere?

20:47.240 --> 20:48.050
No...

20:48.670 --> 20:50.640
Brother, your wound...

20:56.160 --> 20:57.560
You were amazing, Daida.

20:59.760 --> 21:02.770
It shouldn't be surprising 
that I could do that much.

21:07.110 --> 21:10.700
Please excuse us. We brought some 
water and something to eat.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.090
Thanks.

21:14.430 --> 21:16.610
Here, Bojji. Daida.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.570
Let's get you changed and sit down to eat.

21:18.570 --> 21:19.240
Right!

21:20.340 --> 21:32.350
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.640 --> 21:41.360
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:41.360 --> 21:46.490
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:46.990 --> 21:49.990
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:49.990 --> 21:52.830
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.830 --> 21:58.500
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.500 --> 22:01.420
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:01.420 --> 22:04.210
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:04.210 --> 22:14.020
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:14.430 --> 22:20.190
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:27.610
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.610 --> 22:32.200
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:32.200 --> 22:38.670
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.670 --> 22:49.010
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
